+/*
+ * GET CONFIGURATION with a disc model: a CD-ROM drive (one profile), the CD
+ * read feature with C2 pointers and CD external audio play. RT (byte 1 & 3)
+ * 0 = every feature from the starting one on, 1 = the current ones, 2 = that
